### Dispatch Configuration (`.state/workflows.yaml`)

```yaml
configs.mas-self.recovery.5_leveln:
  immune:     recovery --immune     → wf_recovery_immune     → sub_mas-recovery-immune
  checkpoint: recovery --checkpoint → wf_recovery_checkpoint → sub_mas-recovery-checkpoint
  safezone:   recovery --safezone   → wf_recovery_safezone   → sub_mas-recovery-safezone
  timeline:   recovery --timeline   → wf_recovery_timeline   → sub_mas-recovery-timeline
  defib:      recovery --defib      → wf_recovery_defib      → sub_mas-recovery-defib
```

Each level has: `befehl` (CLI trigger), `workflow` (dispatch target), `sub_agent` (delegate), optional `subbefehle`.

### Registration

All 5 recovery workflows registered in:
- `task_workflows` — human-readable descriptions
- `configs.mas-self.sub_agents.recovery` — sub-agent registry
- Monitoring workflow `wf_monitor_recovery_run` for auto-dispatch on agent death/timeout

