The project already has German word detection tooling:
- `tools/pre_check_lib/german.py` — dedicated scanner
- `recipe/sub/sub_mas-e2e-german-fixes-validator.yaml` — validator sub-agent
- `scripts/e2e-test.sh` line 244 — `GERMAN_WORDS` list

The scope of enforcement is **workflow descriptions** (T1 test), not source code or docs.

### Verdict

**CONDITIONAL PASS** — No accidental German words found. All instances are intentional as part of the project's bilingual design. The existing detection infrastructure handles enforcement at the correct scope.

